## Threshold dose-response

Sweep the chr1 X-dominant threshold T across the configured set and
recompute three metrics per (T, ancestry): drift = chr1 median −
mean(chr2..22 medians); median per-sample std(X-prop across
chr1..chr22); mean off-diagonal per-chrom-pair median |X-prop(chr_i)
− X-prop(chr_j)|. Three side-by-side line panels, one line per
ancestry, n-annotated at endpoints.

